			"notes": "### v1.311.71 — 累计更新 (v1.311.66 → v1.311.71)\n\n**问题修复**\n- 修复店铺售出商品与玩家直接购买货架商品时,聊天栏消息中的物品名称显示为英文 ID(如 `bakeries:croissant`)的问题,现在正确显示中文物品名(如\"羊角面包\")\n- 修复 PVE 副本战偶发\"15 秒瞬赢\"的问题(副本判定异常,未真正开打即结算胜利)\n- 修复精灵在被玩家收回或异常丢失后无法重新召唤的问题,现在会自动兜底复活\n- 修复精灵球满/空状态可能同时存在两只精灵的问题\n- 修复携带飞行精灵时,精灵头顶名称与自定义命名不一致的问题\n- 修复精灵会主动追击玩家周围的普通生物(如挖石英时被路过的僵尸引怪)—— 现在精灵**完全被动**,仅当玩家或精灵本身受到攻击时才反击\n\n**玩法调整**\n- 精灵的攻击行为改为**纯被动**:只有玩家攻击目标或玩家/精灵受到攻击时,精灵才会出手,不再主动扫描附近敌人\n- 精灵管理命令扁平化:`/spirit`、`/battle`、`/trade` 现在都可作为独立顶级命令使用(旧的 `/bakersim phase2 phase3 ...` 前缀保留兼容)\n- 新增 `/spirit force_revive` 命令:当精灵实体丢失时可强制复活\n\n**多人服修复**\n- 阻断玩家借自己的飞行精灵刷别人店铺内顾客的漏洞(顾客保护判定加入精灵伤害源)\n- 未挂招牌的货架不再能被其他玩家挖走搬用\n\n**其他**\n- 各种服务端日志级别调整,降低服务器控制台的常规刷屏\n\n---\n\n### English Changelog\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed chat messages showing raw item IDs (e.g., `bakeries:croissant`) when shops sell items or players buy directly from racks — now correctly displays localized item names\n- Fixed occasional \"15-second instant win\" bug in PVE battles\n- Fixed the Bread Spirit failing to be re-summoned after being recalled or lost — a fallback respawn is now guaranteed\n- Fixed a rare state where an empty and a full Spirit Ball could coexist, producing duplicate spirits\n- Fixed the custom name on a worn/flying Spirit not matching the player-assigned name\n- Fixed the Spirit aggressively hunting nearby neutral mobs — the Spirit is now **fully passive**, only retaliating when the player or itself is attacked\n\n**Gameplay Changes**\n- Spirit attack behavior is now **passive-only**\n- Spirit management commands flattened: `/spirit`, `/battle`, `/trade` now available as top-level commands\n- New `/spirit force_revive` command to force-respawn a lost Spirit\n\n**Multiplayer Fixes**\n- Blocked an exploit where players could use their flying Spirit to damage other players' shop customers\n- Racks without a shop sign attached can no longer be broken and relocated by other players\n\n**Misc**\n- Various server log-level adjustments to reduce console spam\n\n---\n\n### 兼容性\n- Minecraft **26.1.2**\n- Mod Loader **NeoForge 26.1.2.73+**\n- 前置(必需): Bakeries, GeckoLib 5.5.2+, Curios 15.0.0-beta.2+\n- 前置(可选): LambDynamicLights 4.11+"
		}
